---
description: Mobile rules (apps/mobile, packages/ui-native)
globs: apps/mobile/**,packages/ui-native/**
---
- UI only from `@trackdesk/ui-native`; styles only from `theme` (tokens). No raw colours or magic numbers.
- Data via the generated `@trackdesk/contracts` client. Offline writes go through `SyncQueue` with client ids and
  Idempotency-Key; job status is server-authoritative (409 → needs attention).
- Location: only via `policy.shouldTrack` (consent + working hours Europe/London + active en_route/on_site job);
  visible `TrackingIndicator` while tracking; all location code is SECURITY-REVIEW-REQUIRED + DPO sign-off.
- Sessions in expo-secure-store; never embed service-role keys.
- Pure logic gets Vitest unit tests; user journeys get Maestro flows in `maestro/`. Device testing is human-only.
